<li><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Donald_Winnicott" title="Donald Winnicott">Winnicott</a></li></ul>

<p><b>Influential figures applying psychoanalysis</b></p>
<ul><li><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Nancy_Chodorow" title="Nancy Chodorow">Chodorow</a></li>
<li><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Julia_Kristeva" title="Julia Kristeva">Kristeva</a></li>
<li><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Luce_Irigaray" title="Luce Irigaray">Irigaray</a></li>
<li><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Slavoj_Žižek" title="Slavoj Žižek">Žižek</a></li></ul>

</div></div></div></td>
</tr><tr><td class="sidebar-content">
<div class="sidebar-list mw-collapsible mw-collapsed"><div class="sidebar-list-title" style="text-align:center;;color: var(--color-base)">Important works</div><div class="sidebar-list-content mw-collapsible-content"><div class="plainlist "><b>Core psychoanalytic texts</b>
<ul><li><i><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/The_Interpretation_of_Dreams" title="The Interpretation of Dreams">The Interpretation of Dreams</a></i> <span style="font-size: 85%;">(1899)</span></li>
<li><i><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/The_Psychopathology_of_Everyday_Life" title="The Psychopathology of Everyday Life">The Psychopathology of Everyday Life</a></i> <span style="font-size: 85%;">(1901)</span></li>
<li><div style="display:inline-block; padding:0.2em 0.4em; line-height:1.2em; "><i><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Three_Essays_on_the_Theory_of_Sexuality" title="Three Essays on the Theory of Sexuality">Three Essays on the Theory<br/>of Sexuality</a></i> <span style="font-size: 85%;">(1905)</span></div></li>
<li><i><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Psychology_of_the_Unconscious" title="Psychology of the Unconscious">Psychology of the Unconscious</a></i> <span style="font-size: 85%;">(1912)</span></li>
<li><i><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Beyond_the_Pleasure_Principle" title="Beyond the Pleasure Principle">Beyond the Pleasure Principle</a></i> <span style="font-size: 85%;">(1920)</span></li>
<li><i><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/The_Ego_and_the_Id" title="The Ego and the Id">The Ego and the Id</a></i> <span style="font-size: 85%;">(1923)</span></li>
<li><i><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Civilization_and_Its_Discontents" title="Civilization and Its Discontents">Civilization and Its Discontents</a></i> <span style="font-size: 85%;">(1930)</span></li>
<li><i><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/The_Mass_Psychology_of_Fascism" title="The Mass Psychology of Fascism">The Mass Psychology of Fascism</a></i> <span style="font-size: 85%;">(1933)</span></li>
<li><i><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/The_Four_Fundamental_Concepts_of_Psychoanalysis" title="The Four Fundamental Concepts of Psychoanalysis">The Four Fundamental Concepts of Psychoanalysis</a></i> <span style="font-size: 85%;">(1964)</span></li></ul>

<p><b>Influential works applying psychoanalysis</b></p>
<ul><li><i><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Anti-Oedipus" title="Anti-Oedipus">Anti-Oedipus</a></i> <span style="font-size: 85%;">(1972)</span></li>
<li><i><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/The_Sublime_Object_of_Ideology" title="The Sublime Object of Ideology">The Sublime Object of Ideology</a></i> <span style="font-size: 85%;">(1989)</span></li></ul>

</div></div></div></td>
