<th id="mw0A">Middle adulthood
<p id="mw0Q">45–64 years<sup about="#mwt77" class="mw-ref reference" id="cite_ref-19" rel="dc:references" typeof="mw:Extension/ref" data-mw='{"name":"ref","attrs":{},"body":{"id":"mw-reference-text-cite_note-19"}}'><a href="#cite_note-19" id="mw0g"><span class="mw-reflink-text" id="mw0w"><span class="cite-bracket" id="mw1A">[</span>19<span class="cite-bracket" id="mw1Q">]</span></span></a></sup></p></th>
<td id="mw1g">Care</td><td id="mw1w">Generativity vs. stagnation</td><td id="mw2A">Household, workmates</td><td id="mw2Q">Can I make my life count?</td><td id="mw2g">Work, parenthood</td></tr>
