</section><section data-mw-section-id="3" id="mw5w" aria-labelledby="Psychological_periodization_of_stages_of_human_development"><div class="mw-heading mw-heading2"><h2 id="Psychological_periodization_of_stages_of_human_development">Psychological periodization of stages of human development</h2><span class="mw-editsection"><span class="mw-editsection-bracket">[</span><a href="/w/index.php?title=Erikson%27s_stages_of_psychosocial_development&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3" title="Edit section: Psychological periodization of stages of human development"><span>edit</span></a><span class="mw-editsection-bracket">]</span></span></div>

