7-4" class="external text" id="mwA68">10.1007/s10804-016-9247-4</a>. <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/ISSN_(identifier)" title="ISSN (identifier)" class="mw-redirect" id="mwA7A">ISSN</a><span typeof="mw:Entity" id="mwA7E"> </span><a rel="mw:ExtLink nofollow" href="https://search.worldcat.org/issn/1068-0667" class="external text" id="mwA7I">1068-0667</a>. <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/S2CID_(identifier)" title="S2CID (identifier)" class="mw-redirect" id="mwA7M">S2CID</a><span typeof="mw:Entity" id="mwA7Q"> </span><a rel="mw:ExtLink nofollow" href="https://api.semanticscholar.org/CorpusID:152099460" class="external text" id="mwA7U">152099460</a>.</cite><span title="ctx_ver=Z39.88-2004&amp;rft_val_fmt=info%3Aofi%2Ffmt%3Akev%3Amtx%3Ajournal&amp;rft.genre=article&amp;rft.jtitle=Journal+of+Adult+Development&amp;rft.atitle=A+Review+of+Measures+of+Erikson%27s+Stages+of+Psychosocial+Development%3A+Evidence+for+a+General+Factor&amp;rft.volume=24&amp;rft.issue=1&amp;rft.pages=58-76&amp;rft.date=2017-03-01&amp;rft_id=https%3A%2F%2Fapi.semanticscholar.org%2FCorpusID%3A152099460%23id-name%3DS2CID&amp;rft.issn=1068-0667&amp;rft_id=info%3Adoi%2F10.1007%2Fs10804-016-9247-4&amp;rft.aulast=Dunkel&amp;rft.aufirst=Curtis+S.&amp;rft.au=Harbke%2C+Colin&amp;rfr_id=info%3Asid%2Fen.wikipedia.org%3AErikson%27s+stages+of+psychosocial+development" class="Z3988" about="#mwt66" id="mwA7Y"></span></span></li>
